sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Your device
  participant M as MemDot
  participant T as TransactionStorage
  participant R as MemDotRegistry

  D->>D: Encrypt, and compute the CID
  D->>M: Upload ciphertext
  M->>T: store
  T-->>D: Stored at block and index, finalized
  D->>M: Record signed with the owner's key
  M->>R: EVM transaction
  R->>R: sr25519Verify the owner
  R-->>D: Recorded event, readable by anyone
  Note over M,T: By day 5.6 of the 7-day window
  M->>T: renew, same CID, new location
  D->>T: Verify, fetch by CID and hash the bytes
